      "type": "code",
      "text": "from fnmatch import *\nfor x in range(9117, 10**9, 9117):\n    if fnmatch(str(x), '4*64*9?7'):\n        print(x)\n\n# Ответ:\n# 464967\n# 41764977\n# 406444977\n# 436439907\n# 464337927\n# 464884947"
